<center><h1>What's on in Oslo, July 1995</h1></center>


<dl>

<b>Saturday 1st</b><p><dl>
  
    <dt>10:00 Norway Games at Bislett.
 
    <dt>12:30 Guided tour in english of Viking Exhibition at Historic Museum.

    <dt>13:00 Horseracing at Øvrevoll Galoppbane.
 
    <dt>21.00 Carlene Carter and her band at Rockefeller.
  </dl> 
  <p>

  
