  <dt>10:00 Norway Games at Bislett.
  
    <dt>12:30 Guided tour in english of Viking Exhibition at Historic Museum.

    <dt>13:30 American Independence Day Celebration in Frogner Park.

    <dd>Parade, games &amp; activies, King's Guard drill team, C&amp;W music, square dance, american food and much more.
  
    <dt>14:00 Concert at Akershus Castle.
  </dl>
<p>

  
